# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.a {
    .b {
        @if $enabled {
            color: red;
        }
    }
}

// An `@else` block belongs to its `@if`, so the whole chain is reported once.
.a {
    .b {
        @if $theme == dark {
            color: white;
        } @else if $theme == light {
            color: black;
        } @else {
            color: gray;
        }
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        @each $name in $names {
            color: $name;
        }
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        @for $i from 1 through 3 {
            width: $i * 1px;
        }
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        @while $i > 0 {
            width: $i * 1px;
        }
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        @include breakpoint(md) {
            color: red;
        }
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        font: {
            family: sans-serif;
        }
    }
}

@mixin theme {
    .a {
        .b {
            .c {
                color: red;
            }
        }
    }
}

```

